flowchart TD
    Start([开始]) --> OpenPOS[POS Opening Entry<br/>开班]
    OpenPOS --> ValidateProfile{验证POS Profile<br/>和收银员}
    ValidateProfile -->|通过| SetStatus1[设置状态: Open]
    ValidateProfile -->|失败| Error1[抛出异常]
    
    SetStatus1 --> CreateInvoice[创建POS Invoice<br/>POS单据]
    CreateInvoice --> ScanItem[扫码/添加商品]
    ScanItem --> ApplyPrice[应用价格规则]
    ApplyPrice --> AddMoreItems{继续添加?}
    AddMoreItems -->|是| ScanItem
    AddMoreItems -->|否| Payment[选择支付方式]
    
    Payment --> ValidatePayment{验证支付金额}
    ValidatePayment -->|不足| Payment
    ValidatePayment -->|通过| Submit[提交单据 on_submit]
    
    Submit --> MakeLoyalty[创建积分分录<br/>make_loyalty_point_entry]
    MakeLoyalty --> MakeGL[生成总账分录<br/>GL Entry]
    MakeGL --> MakeStock[生成库存分录<br/>Stock Ledger Entry]
    MakeStock --> UpdateBin[更新库存Bin]
    UpdateBin --> InvoiceComplete([单据完成])
    
    InvoiceComplete --> MoreInvoices{继续开单?}
    MoreInvoices -->|是| CreateInvoice
    MoreInvoices -->|否| ClosePOS[POS Closing Entry<br/>交班]
    
    ClosePOS --> ReconcilePayment[核对支付金额]
    ReconcilePayment --> ValidateClosing{验证交班数据}
    ValidateClosing -->|通过| SetStatus2[设置Opening状态: Closed]
    ValidateClosing -->|失败| Error2[抛出异常]
    SetStatus2 --> End([结束])
